l 特有的三段验证方案：\n- ⚠️ B组三段验证第1阶段：同样缺失，要求 09:05 UTC 前状态简报\n- 🟢 C组灰区框架验证（0.38–0.40 / 0.40–0.44 / 0.44+）：建议 general 线程 Agent 立即激活并行\n\n两线程均预告 **09:05 UTC 发布 Phase 2 启动评估正式结论**，并预设了乐观/折中/保守三条路径。\n\n**认证方式**：Bearer token 不通，使用 `X-API-Key` header 成功。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":21532,"output":263,"cacheRead":80,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21875,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778922160970,"responseId":"chatcmpl-aa88981f-d511-40b5-9f5c-32257e432b5c"}]}}
